category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libprotobuf-devel zlib-devel
sdesc: "Tools related to PBF (an alternative to XML format) (sample data)"
ldesc: "Osmpbf is a Java/C library to read and write OpenStreetMap PBF files. PBF
(Protocol buffer Binary Format) is a binary file format for OpenStreetMap data
that uses Google Protocol Buffers as low-level storage."
skip:

homepage: https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/PBF_Format
license: LGPL-3.0-or-later
